WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.680
MY LOVE OF MOVIES BEGAN AT
THE LOCAL DRIVE-IN,

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:04.640
WATCHING THE LIKES OF

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.760
CLINT EASTWOOD AND GODZILLA.
OUR NOMINEES FOR

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.600
BEST SUPPORTING ACTRESS -

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.920
ALSO FELL IN LOVE WITH
MOVIES AT AN EARLY AGE.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.280
FOR YUH-JUNG YOUN IT WAS
THROUGH THE WORK OF

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.200
ACTRESSES LIKE MAGGIE SMITH

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.280
AND DIRECTORS ROBERT ALTMAN
AND MIKE LEIGH.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.400
FOR AMANDA SEYFRIED IT WAS THE

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.640
FILM VERSION OF
"ROMEO AND JULIET,"

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:27.520
THE LEO VERSION.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.680
AMANDA. ME, TOO.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:36.240
MARIA BAKALOVA IT WAS ALL ABOUT
MARILYN MONROE.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.920
SHE'D WRITE OUT,
MARILYN'S QUOTE

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.920
"I'M GOING TO BE A GREAT
MOVIE STAR SOME DAY."

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.840
MARIA, WELCOME.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.560
AS A YOUNG GIRL OLIVIA COLMAN'S
FAMILY WOULD GATHER AT CHRISTMAS

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.600
TIME, GET SOME POPCORN AND WATCH
"THE SOUND OF MUSIC" AND

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.640
"CHITTY CHITTY BANG BANG."

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.880
AND FOR THE GREAT GLENN CLOSE
SHE WAS ENTRANCED BY CLASSIC DISNEY

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.560
MOVIES LIKE "SNOW WHITE,"

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.680
AND "OLD YELLER."

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.920
AND APPARENTLY IT PAID OFF
SHE ENDED UP BEING CAST AS

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:02.720
CRUELLA DE VIL.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:06.720
THESE ARE THE NOMINEES
FOR THE BEST SUPPORTING ACTRESS

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:11.840
AND THE OSCAR GOES TO-
YUH-JUNG YOUN. 

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:20.400
[CHEERS AND APPLAUSE]

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.336
MR. BRAD PITT, FINALLY.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.238
NICE TO MEET YOU.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.132
WHERE WERE YOU
WHEN WE WERE FILMING?

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.194
IT'S AN HONOR TO MEET YOU.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:00.480
AS YOU KNOW, I'M FROM KOREA.
AND ACTUALLY MY NAME, IS

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.440
YUH-JUNG YOUN.

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:04.880
AND MOST EUROPEAN PEOPLE
CALL ME YUH-YOUN

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.040
-- AND SOME OF THEM CALL ME --
YUH-JUNG

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.524
BUT TONIGHT,

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.445
YOU ARE ALL FORGIVEN.

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:17.600
AND USUALLY WHEN I'M LIVING IN

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:20.560
THE OTHER PART OF THE WORLD, I
JUST WATCH THE TELEVISION.

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:28.720
IT'S OSCAR, AN EVENT ON THE
TELEVISION, JUST WATCHING, LIKE

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:33.680
A TELEVISION PROGRAM FOR US.
BUT ME BEING HERE, BY MYSELF,

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:40.000
THIS, I CANNOT BELIEVE I'M HERE.
OKAY.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.520
LET ME PULL MYSELF TOGETHER.
OKAY.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:51.520
THANK YOU FOR THE TREMENDOUS,
THANKS TO THE ACADEMY MEMBERS

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:56.640
WHO VOTE FOR ME.
AND THAT'S THE SPEECH,

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:03.840
THEY USUALLY SAY, OKAY, THANK YOU FOR
THE -- WONDERFUL MINARI FAMILY.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:13.120
STEVEN, ISAAC, YERI, AND NOEL, ALAN
WE BECAME A FAMILY.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:17.600
AND MOST OF ALL, ABOVE ALL,
LEE ISAAC CHUNG

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.080
WITHOUT HIM, I COULDN'T BE HERE

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.594
TONIGHT.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.446
HE WAS OUR CAPTAIN AND MY
DIRECTOR.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.360
SO THANKS TO YOU.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:38.382
TREMENDOUS THANKS TO YOU.
AND I'D LIKE TO THANK --

00:03:38.382 --> 00:03:44.800
I DON'T BELIEVE IN COMPETITION.
HOW CAN I WIN OVER GLENN CLOSE?

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.795
I'VE BEEN&nbsp;&nbsp;WATCHING HER,
SO MANY PERFORMANCES.

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:52.929
SO THIS IS JUST -- ALL THE
NOMINEES, FIVE NOMINEES.

00:03:52.929 --> 00:03:56.931
WE WERE THE WINNER FOR THE
DIFFERENT MOVIE, WE PLAY THE

00:03:56.931 --> 00:04:00.530
DIFFERENT ROLE.
SO WE CANNOT COMPETE EACH OTHER.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:05.200
TONIGHT, I HAVE JUST A LITTLE
BIT LUCK, I THINK.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:12.960
I'M LUCKIER THAN YOU.
AND ALSO, MAYBE IS AMERICAN

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:16.320
HOSPITALITY FOR THE KOREAN
ACTOR?

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.440
I'M NOT SURE.
BUT ANYWAY, THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:24.480
AND I'D LIKE TO THANK TO MY TWO
BOYS.

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:34.560
WHO MADE ME GO OUT AND WORK.
SO -- THIS IS THE RESULT.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:39.680
BECAUSE MOMMY WORKED SO HARD.
AND I WOULD LIKE TO DEDICATE

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:44.480
THIS AWARD FOR MY FIRST
DIRECTOR. KIM KI-YOUNG

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:51.040
WHO WAS VERY GENIUS DIRECTOR, I
MADE THE MOVIE TOGETHER WITH

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.080
HIM, FIRST MOVIE.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.240
I THINK HE WOULD BE VERY HAPPY

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:57.520
IF HE WAS STILL ALIVE.
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:02.551
TREMENDOUS THANK YOU FOR THIS.
THANK YOU.

